      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present this stunning A Rated 3 bedroom, 3 bathroom Family home to the market ideally positioned on Stratton Drive, Adamstown. This sought after development is located close to Lucan Village with all amenities on your doorstep including local bars, shops, schools, along with a host of bus routes. The N4 & M50 road networks and Adamstown Train Station are within a stones throw making commuting and access to the City Centre a breeze.\n \nBright and spacious living accommodation of c.105 sqm in brief comprises of an entrance hallway with a guest W.C, front living room flooded with natural light, large open-plan kitchen/dining area with separate utility room which provides direct access to the SOUTH facing, low-maintenance rear garden. The first floor hosts three generously proportioned bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with en-suite, together with the main family bathroom. To the front of the property, there is a bin store and designated parking for two cars.\n \nNo. 7 is presented in Turn Key condition throughout and further benefits from an A Ber rating, designated parking, SOUTH facing rear garden with artificial grass and decking area. Based on the condition of this property and continued success in the Adamstown area, we know this property will be very popular so contact Ray Cooke Auctioneers to register your interest or arrange a viewing.\n \n \nAdditonal Features: \n<ul>\n <li> A3 rated BER qualifying of a green mortgage </li>\n <li> 3 BED / 3 BATH mid terraced home  </li>\n <li> Built in 2017</li>\n <li> Peaceful development close to all amenities</li>\n <li> SOUTH facing rear garden with artificial grass and decking area</li>\n <li> Designated Parking to the front </li>\n <li> Built in wardrobes </li>\n <li> Management fees c. 550 p/a </li>\n <li> Gas central heating </li>\n <li> Adamstown Train Station within easy reach</li>\n <li> Lucan Village & Liffey Valley Shopping Centre in close proximity</li>\n <li> Viewing highly advised</li>\n</ul>\n \nDirections: \n \nEircode = K78 YR94"
      },
      {
